<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "in any manner whatsoever to advertise or publicise or to cause to be advertised or publicised any entertainment to be performed in a place of entenainment, unless there has been a licence granted under section 4 in respect of that entertainment."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
