<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_18> <https://schema.org/text> "rank of Inspeccor, or any authorized person may require any person whom he reasonably believes to have comrnitted an offence under this Act or any rules made thereunder to give his name, identity card nurnber and address."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
