<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_19__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commissioner. any police officer not below the rank of Inspector, or any authorized person may arrest without warrant—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
