<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_19__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_19__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
