<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_19__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A person arrested under this section shall be taken to a police station and shall be brought before the court within twenty-four hours unless, in respect of a person arrested under subsection (1)(b), his name and address are sooner ascertained, whereupon he shall then be released on bail."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
