<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An application for a licence under section 4 (1) shall be made in the prescribed form and shall be submitted to the Commissioner. BILL"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
