<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commissioner may, in his discretion, grant a licence with or without attaching any condition or conditions thereto or refuse to grant such a licence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
