<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where application for a licence is granted, such licence shall be issued upon payment of the prescribed fee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "No entertainment licence shall be granted under this Act unless a licence has been obtained from the Commissioner to open the place of entertainment at which that entertainment is going to be provided."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
