<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commissioner shall pay all monies collected under this section into the fund constituted under any law relating to local government."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
