<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_6__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purpose of considering an application for an entertainment licence, the Commissioner may require the applicant to furnish to him the script, if any, and such information as he may specify relating to the following matters:"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
