<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@/~cl_6__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purpose of considering an application for a licence to open an entertainment place, Commissioner may require the applicant to furnish to him such additional inforrnation as he may require."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/19/eng@> .
